 "guidance": [
  "NPC hint: the Elephant Trainer warns about Stompy's head, which is where the aquarium trigger is (LP4 2:24:00)",
  "three of four banners visible from the banner-goal start (THG)",
  "animals mark places: hippos (A), elephant (aquarium), lions and Kong (pro events)",
  "2025: night arena with lit bowls and a clock tower; penguins above QPs and in open spaces"
 ],
 "designLogic": [
  "no tape in either version; the locked aquarium plays the secret-area role in 2002; remake Zoo is a tape-less competition",
  "animals are the machinery: hippo boost, elephant skitch/trigger, lion chase, Kong switches, birds, moving mascot",
  "the hint is in dialogue: the trainer warns away from the exact trigger",
  "one locked room used once: 2 of 5 penguins inside",
  "the highest letter (E) crowns the cage climb taught by the letter order",
  "water and pools are soft failure",
  "pro goals climb to the roof and wire layer",
  "remake secrets still teach wire (deck) and wall (logo via wallride/wallie) layers",
  "remake platinum penguins are a collect-five arena circuit inside a 1-minute heat",
  "goal starts and skitches fold a big map: Pro Score starts on the snack-bar roof; LP4 skitches a zoo cart to the aquarium",
  "escape stories (penguins, lions, monkey, Kong) justify roaming targets"
 ],
 "remakeChanges": [
  "2002 free-roam street level (16 + 5 goals) -> 2025 competition arena with a platinum penguin hunt",
  "no tape in either; no S-K-A-T-E in 2025",
  "remake brands Zoo as London's Royal Zoo ('Zoo - London', 'THE ROYAL ZOO', 'SAVE STOMPY' banner) tying it to London's Free Stompy goal"
 ],
 "transfer": [
  "Animal trampoline: moving creatures in a pool as trampolines; crystal ~1-2 m above a plain ollie's 1.78 m",
